        "original_id": "ebc6cc97-a20d-50e9-bdde-ccd590d76570",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Breakable You\n- People: Brian Morton, Alfred Molina, Holly Hunter, Tony Shalhoub\n- Roles: American author, English-American actor\n- Films: Breakable You film adaptation, Raiders of the Lost Ark, Enchanted April, Maverick, Boogie Nights, Chocolat, Spider-Man 2, The Da Vinci Code, An Education, The Sorcerer's Apprentice, Rango, Whiskey Tango Foxtrot\n\nFacts:\n- Alfred Molina was born on 24 May 1953 and is an English-American actor.\n- Alfred Molina is known for roles in Raiders of the Lost Ark (1981), Enchanted April (1992), Maverick (1994), Boogie Nights (1997), Chocolat (2000), Spider-Man 2 (2004), The Da Vinci Code (2006), An Education (2009), The Sorcerer's Apprentice (2010), Rango (2011), and Whiskey Tango Foxtrot (2016).\n- Breakable You is the fourth novel written by American author Brian Morton.\n- The book Breakable You was adapted into a 2017 film starring Holly Hunter, Tony Shalhoub, and Alfred Molina.",
